gcZh(){return"Search and filters"},
gcZg(){return"\u2022 When a search box appears above the table, type to filter. The list refreshes shortly after you pause typing.\n\u2022 For a specific column, open the \u22ee menu on that column header and choose Search, set the condition, then Apply.\n\u2022 Active filters appear as chips below the header. Remove one chip or use Clear filters when that button is shown."},
gcZ9(){return"Export (Excel / PDF)"},
gcZ8(){return"\u2022 Open the \u22ee menu at the top right of the table.\n\u2022 Choose Excel or PDF for all rows, or for selected rows only when row checkboxes are enabled and you have selected rows.\n\u2022 The Export entry with extra text opens more options (templates, layout, etc.) when the business enables them.\n\u2022 A download icon in the header may offer the same export flow."},
gcZl(){return"Sorting and columns"},
gcZk(){return"\u2022 Click a column title to sort by that column; click again to switch ascending / descending.\n\u2022 Hold Shift and click another column title to add or adjust a second-level sort.\n\u2022 When you hover a header, use its \u22ee menu for column search, pin to left or right, hide column, auto-fit width, or reset column layout (depending on what this table allows).\n\u2022 Column settings in the top \u22ee menu lets you show, hide, and reorder columns."},
gcZb(){return"Keyboard shortcuts"},
gcZa(){return"First click on the table body (not inside the search field) so the table has focus.\n\n\u2022 J or Down arrow: move highlight to the next row.\n\u2022 K or Up arrow: move highlight to the previous row.\n\u2022 Enter: open the highlighted row when this page supports opening a row.\n\u2022 Space: toggle selection of the highlighted row when selection is enabled.\n\u2022 Escape: clear row selection.\n\u2022 Ctrl+A: select all rows on the current page when multi-select is enabled."},
gcZf(){return"Wide tables and horizontal scroll"},
gcZe(){return"\u2022 When there are many columns, a horizontal scrollbar appears under the table. Drag it to see hidden columns.\n\u2022 With a mouse wheel: move the pointer over the table and hold Shift while scrolling the wheel to scroll sideways (common on Windows and Linux browsers).\n\u2022 On a trackpad, use a horizontal two-finger swipe. On touch screens, drag the table sideways."},
gcZj(){return"Row selection and copying"},
gcZi(){return"\u2022 Use the checkboxes in the first column when selection is enabled.\n\u2022 With multi-select, hold Shift and click another row to select everything between the last selection and that row.\n\u2022 Long-press (or right-click where supported) on a cell value to copy it to the clipboard."},
gcZd(){return"Other controls"},
gcZc(){return"\u2022 Refresh in the \u22ee menu reloads data from the server.\n\u2022 Compact mode toggles denser row height; your choice may be remembered for this table.\n\u2022 Use pagination at the bottom to change page size and move between pages."},
